{{Term/Store|Tabantha Moose|Tabantha Moose|Series, BotW, TotK|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite|'''Tabantha Moose'''|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|'''Tabantha Moose'''|Hyrule Compendium|TotK}}</ref>

==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Tabantha Moose}}
Tabantha Moose are a large species of [[Deer]] exclusively found in the snowy, montane areas of [[Hyrule]].<ref name="Compendium">{{Cite|The largest breed of deer in Hyrule, this mammal's origin was traced back to the Tabantha region. It's easily distinguished by its immense antlers, which these moose shed and regrow yearly. Their meat is tender and high quality, so it works well in a stew.|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref> The [[Hyrule Compendium]] specifies the [[Hebra Mountains]] and [[Gerudo Highlands]] as common locations where they can be found, but they are also present on the [[Tabantha Tundra]] and [[Mount Lanayru]]. Tabantha Moose are known for their large antlers, which they shed and regrow annually.<ref name="Compendium"/>

Despite their size, Tabantha Moose are skittish [[Creature]]s that will flee at the slightest detection of sound. Tabantha Moose are known for their high-quality meat, and they drop [[Raw Prime Meat]] or [[Raw Gourmet Meat]] when they are killed.<ref name="Compendium"/>

==={{TotK|-}}===
