==Trivia==
* The Tabantha Moose is the only species of Deer that [[Link]] cannot mount or ride in {{BotW|-}}.
* Tabantha Moose resemble and are likely based on bull {{wp|moose}}, massive Deer found in forests of the northern hemisphere.
** Tabantha Moose are physically only reflective of male moose. There are no Tabantha Moose resembling female moose in {{BotW|-}}.

